; One variable against unit-sub-viewport-container-translucent.tscn: the content kind. A
; translucent 3D surface blends in linear light inside the target, whose SRGB8_ALPHA8 storage
; encodes the result, so the blend differs from the canvas target's sRGB-number blend. Godot 4.6.3
; reads (170,180) rgb(193, 90, 54).

